  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>99</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is divided by <math><mn>100</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the remainder obtained is"
